    "A REPRESENTATIVE herdr SessionSnapshot, built to the installed herdr's own API schema",
    "(`herdr api schema --json`, protocol 22, schema_version 1): the required keys of",
    "success_response/$defs/SessionSnapshot are version, protocol, workspaces, tabs, panes,",
    "layouts and agents; the record shapes are WorkspaceInfo, TabInfo, PaneInfo, AgentInfo",
    "and PaneLayoutSnapshot.",
    "",
    "It is SYNTHETIC: no real lane, no real path, no real session. It exists so the capture",
    "path can be tested against the documented envelope without capturing the live fleet.",
